{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2021-03-25 06:05:00', 'title': 'COGNIZANT TO EXPAND EXPERTISE IN AUTONOMOUS, CONNECTED AND ELECTRIC VEHICLES WITH ACQUISITION OF ESG MOBILITY', 'text': 'TEANECK, N.J., MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COGNIZANT (NASDAQ: CTSH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS ACQUIRING MUNICH, GERMANY-BASED ESG MOBILITY, A DIGITAL AUTOMOTIVE ENGINEERING R&D PROVIDER FOR CONNECTED, AUTONOMOUS AND ELECTRIC VEHICLES.'}